灯台の後ろ姿が見える。」","nextNodeIds":[735020102]},{"nodeId":735020102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1777372130,"text":"な、なんだコレ…謎解きか？それとも諺とか…？","nextNodeIds":[735020103]},{"nodeId":735020103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2930095146,"text":"昼間と交代する昼間？た、退勤する後ろ姿…？","nextNodeIds":[735020104]},{"nodeId":735020104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4022,"speakerName":"カマル","textMapHash":1284883018,"text":"旅人じゃないか！あんたらもデルースさんの謎解きに興味があるのか？","nextNodeIds":[735020105,735020106]},{"nodeId":735020105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":55959882,"text":"これ、本当に謎解きなの？","nextNodeIds":[735020107]},{"nodeId":735020107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4022,"speakerName":"カマル","textMapHash":1878044386,"text":"ああ、この謎解きは教令院の学者、デルースさんが出したんだ。","nextNodeIds":[735020108]},{"nodeId":735020108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4022,"speakerName":"カマル","textMapHash":950665058,"text":"俺の知る限り…あの人は教令院でも変人と呼ばれているらしいぞ…","nextNodeIds":[735020109]},{"nodeId":735020109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4022,"speakerName":"カマル","textMapHash":3199754146,"text":"彼は人とあらゆる種類の謎解きについて議論したり、色々な暗号を研究したりするのが好きなんだ。","nextNodeIds":[735020110]},{"nodeId":735020110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4022,"speakerName":"カマル","textMapHash":742037970,"text":"だが、彼の謎解きには難解すぎるものもあって…そのせいで、彼と交流しようとする人は滅多にいない。","nextNodeIds":[735020111]},{"nodeId":735020111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4022,"speakerName":"カマル","textMapHash":2431578162,"text":"そこで、こういう「なぞなぞに報酬をつける」方法を編み出したってわけだ。","nextNodeIds":[735020112]},{"nodeId":735020112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4022,"speakerName":"カマル","textMapHash":958671258,"text":"簡単に言えば、この謎解きはとある「宝蔵地」を示している。","nextNodeIds":[735020113]},{"nodeId":735020113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4022,"speakerName":"カマル","textMapHash":206646106,"text":"正しい時間に、正しい方法で、正しい場所に到達できれば、宝を手に入れられるんだ。","nextNodeIds":[735020114]},{"nodeId":735020114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4022,"speakerName":"カマル","textMapHash":3466360202,"text":"それから、デルースさんはヒントもくれた。これらの「宝蔵地」は、どれもスメールシティの中にあるそうだ。","nextNodeIds":[735020115]},{"nodeId":735020115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4022,"speakerName":"カマル","textMapHash":723947234,"text":"だが…見ての通り、この謎解きを解いた冒険者は今までに一人もいない。","nextNodeIds":[735020116]},{"nodeId":735020116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4022,"speakerName":"カマル","textMapHash":3121981538,"text":"もし興味があるなら、あんたも試してみるといい。","nextNodeIds":[735020117]},{"nodeId":735020117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4022,"speakerName":"カマル","textMapHash":2424363282,"text":"まあ、俺に言わせれば、もっと重要なことを優先したほうがいいと思うが…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":735020106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2571802178,"text":"なぞなぞの出題者を知ってるの？","nextNodeIds":[735020107]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7350201,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133302264"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_NOTIFY_GROUP_LUA"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["133302433"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_UNREGISTER_DYNAMIC_GROUP"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["20834"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7350207,"order":2,"stepDescription":"","stepDescTextMapHash":0,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[101957,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_OBTAIN_ITEM","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHE